OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain soon
OL,6,Fclearing the east, then dry for a
OL,7,Fbrief time before frequent showers
OL,8,Farrive through the evening and
OL,9,Fovernight, turning heavy at times.
OL,10,FBecoming windy overnight with gales
OL,11,Fdeveloping.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FStorm Boelo brings widespread
OL,14,Fwesterly severe gales. Frequent
OL,15,Fshowers in the morning, heavy at
OL,16,Ftimes, with drier interludes
OL,17,Fdeveloping from the afternoon. Winds
OL,18,Feasing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
