OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fand bright morning Monday, becoming
OL,7,Fbreezy with rain later. Very windy
OL,8,Fwith rain or showers on Tuesday.
OL,9,FBright spells and scattered showers on
OL,10,FWednesday, driest in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
